DESCRIPTION >
    Dashboard: raw recent-activity feed, trailing 30 minutes (any event
    type). Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port
    of api/routes/dashboard.js:624-652 (queryName 'recent_activity_events').
    HYBRID IDENTITY (flagged per dispatch): the live query selects BOTH the
    typed distinct_id column AND the JSON-bag properties.anonymous_id — ported
    faithfully as both fields exactly as the live query uses them, not
    collapsed to one. distinct_id is the canonical stitching key (rule #19a);
    anonymous_id here is a legacy/bag passenger field, not a second identity
    join key — no argMin/argMax in this query.
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id ->
    site_id, event -> event_type, properties.page_url -> page_url,
    properties.referrer -> referrer, properties.utm_medium -> utm_medium,
    properties.utm_source -> utm_source, properties.first_touch_source ->
    first_touch_source, properties.first_touch_medium -> first_touch_medium,
    properties.first_touch_campaign -> first_touch_campaign, properties.gclid
    -> gclid, properties.fbclid -> fbclid, properties.msclkid -> msclkid,
    properties.ttclid -> ttclid, properties.li_fat_id -> li_fat_id,
    properties.ai_source -> ai_source, properties.conversion_value ->
    conversion_value (typed Float64 DEFAULT 0).
    JSON-BAG FIELDS HIT (flagged): properties.user_id and properties.
    anonymous_id are both in §2.6's enumerated bag list, not typed columns —
    read via JSONExtractString(properties, '<key>').
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE dashboard_recent_activity_events_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        event_type,
        timestamp,
        page_url,
        referrer,
        utm_medium,
        utm_source,
        first_touch_source,
        first_touch_medium,
        first_touch_campaign,
        gclid,
        fbclid,
        msclkid,
        ttclid,
        li_fat_id,
        ai_source,
        conversion_value,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'user_id') AS user_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'anonymous_id') AS anonymous_id,
        distinct_id
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 MINUTE
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1000

TYPE endpoint
